  "question": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is a first order reaction. The initial pressure of the system was found to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math> which increased to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1600</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math> after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math>. The total pressure of the system after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>min will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math>. (Nearest integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2200",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The final pressure of each component can be calculated as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>intial</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>At</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>time</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1600</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>800</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>400</mn></math></p><p>The first order reaction rate constant can be calculated as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mn>800</mn><mn>400</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math> min,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn></mrow><mn>30</mn></mfrac><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>800</mn><mrow><mn>800</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>800</mn><mrow><mn>800</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>700</mn></math></p><p>Total pressure after <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn></math> min</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1400</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math></p>",
